<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Cecil County | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Cecil County, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Trusted Legal Representation in Cecil County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Cecil County sits at the head of the Chesapeake Bay, where Interstate 95 connects Maryland to 
    Delaware and points north. From the county seat in Elkton to communities like North East, 
    Perryville, and Rising Sun, residents face unique legal challenges that require experienced 
    representation. Attorney Alex Poberesky provides dedicated personal injury and criminal defense 
    services throughout Cecil County.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Cecil County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Cecil County's position along I-95, one of the nation's busiest interstate highways, means 
    residents frequently encounter dangerous traffic conditions. Whether you've been injured in a 
    collision near the Delaware border, hurt in a trucking accident along Route 40, or suffered 
    injuries at one of the county's industrial facilities, you deserve compensation for your losses.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle all types of personal injury cases in Cecil County, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on I-95, Route 40, and local roads</li>
    <li>Truck and commercial vehicle accidents</li>
    <li>Motorcycle accidents</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries at manufacturing and distribution facilities</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents at businesses and properties</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at local healthcare facilities</li>
    <li>Boating accidents on the Chesapeake Bay and Susquehanna River</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Cecil County</h3>
  
  <p>
    If you're facing criminal charges in Cecil County, you need an attorney who understands the 
    local court system and will fight aggressively for your rights. We defend clients against 
    charges including DUI/DWI, drug offenses, theft, assault, and other criminal matters.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Why Choose Our Firm for Your Cecil County Case?</h3>
  
  <p>
    While our office is located in Pikesville, we regularly travel to Cecil County to meet with 
    clients and appear in court. Our 26+ years of experience practicing throughout Maryland means 
    we know how to navigate the Cecil County legal system effectively. We offer free consultations 
    and work on contingency for personal injury cases, meaning you pay nothing unless we win.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Cecil County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Cecil County, including Elkton, North East, Perryville, 
    Rising Sun, Chesapeake City, Charlestown, Port Deposit, and Cecilton. No matter where in 
    the county your injury occurred or where you're facing charges, we're here to help.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
